        "type": "nodetool.workflows.base_node.Comment",
        "data": {
          "comment": "# Consistent Cast Storyboard\n\n**Consistent Cast Storyboard** keeps your lead character identical across a 6-shot sequence.\n\n1. **CreateEntity** binds the lead's portrait and wardrobe descriptor into a cast list.\n2. **Director** plans six shots with framing and camera moves, then **RenderStills**, **RenderClips**, and **AssembleTimeline** produce the finished sequence."
        },
